source: crates/daemon/tests/integration/cli_help.rs
expression: stdout
---
Inspect or approve local pairing requests

Usage: mxr serve pair [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  list
  approve  Preview by default; compare the challenge before --confirm
  help     Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --format <FORMAT>  Structured output (json or jsonl) [possible values: table, json, jsonl, csv, ids]
  -h, --help             Print help
